source: tui/src/onboarding/auth.rs
expression: visible
---
  Choose a provider account for Corbanu Terminal

  1. Provider: OpenAI Codex Account
     Sign in with device code

> 2. Provider: OpenAI API Key
     Use the OpenAI auth store

  3. Provider: Anthropic Claude Account
     Use Claude subscription access; long-lived token recommended or Claude Code
login

  4. Corbanu API
     Queue protected wallet and API-key setup; it runs after Done

  5. Provider: Ambient API Key
     Use a key stored as AMBIENT_API_KEY

  6. Provider: Z.AI API Key
     Use a key stored as ZAI_API_KEY

  7. Provider: OpenRouter API Key
     Use a key stored as OPENROUTER_API_KEY

  8. Provider: Baseten API Key
     Use a key stored as BASETEN_API_KEY

  9. Provider: Vercel API Key
     Use a key stored as AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY

  10. Provider: Amazon Bedrock
  Use ↑/↓ to choose · Press enter to continue · 2 / 13
